5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I hate doing math before turning on the lights. Let's fix this so we can just live.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the actual numbers before we agree to anything. No promises yet.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Who is doing the math? I don't want to be the one chasing everyone for money.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The old split is broken. We need to know who is actually using what.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I just want us to stop avoiding each other over these bills.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if we don't decide now, winter will be miserable again.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, I hear you. But I need to know the cost of changing things.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if we meter rooms, does that mean I have to log everything?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, it depends on the method. I want to check the history first.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I think looking at the last year's statements is a good start.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm worried about the heating. I sat in a coat last winter.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'll look at the payment log to see how late we've been.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I want to see how long the monthly settle takes at other houses.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll check the electrician's quote for meters. It might be too expensive.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll look at the kitchen notice about the cooler. It shows our tension.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Let's hope this works out. I just want a warm home.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will review the data carefully.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I hope it doesn't take all my evenings.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Facts will settle this.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Let's be honest with each other.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
