35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The bills swing wildly. February was almost three times August. And two rooms need heat way earlier.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The payment log shows we are often late. And the electrician quote is 34,000 yen per room. That's steep.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"At the other house, the monthly settle took forty minutes. And the template trial was a nightmare of manual entry.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The meters cost a lot, but the usage difference is huge. One room uses four times more than another.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The cooler notice stayed up all summer. People were sweating to avoid arguing. And the last move-in took three weeks to settle.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, 34,000 yen is a lot. But if we don't fix the heating split, I'll be freezing again.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, I know. But I can't commit to that cost without seeing if it saves us money long-term.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if one room uses four times more, the flat share is unfair. But who pays for the meters?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, that's the question. The usage data is clear. The cost is the barrier.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, the manual work is the real problem. I don't want to be the one doing the math.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"What if we just agree on a fixed amount for winter? No meters, no math.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,A fixed amount might work if we settle the difference at the end of the year.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,That sounds like less work for me. But will people still argue about the final bill?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we use a seasonal fixed rate, we avoid the metering cost. But we need to trust the final settlement.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I think a fixed rate is better than the current chaos. It reduces the daily friction.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I like the idea of a fixed rate. It feels safer.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I can accept a seasonal fixed rate if the year-end settlement is clear.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"As long as it doesn't take hours to calculate, I'm in.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,It's a reasonable compromise. Let's vote on it.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It stops the constant tension.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
