60,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A is Seasonal Fixed Rate. Option B is Per-Room Metering. Option C is Flat Household Share.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,I prefer A. It avoids the high upfront cost of B and the unfairness of C.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,I also prefer A. It minimizes the monthly work for whoever is managing it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"A is the most practical. B is too expensive, and C is outdated.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,A seems best for our relationships. It reduces the need for constant negotiation.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, do you think the year-end settlement will be too complicated?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, it will be some work, but only once a year. Much better than monthly disputes.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, are you sure the fixed rate will cover the high winter bills?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, we can set the rate based on the last twelve months' data. It should be accurate.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I think we should just go with A. It's the least disruptive.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm voting for A.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'm voting for A.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
