74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm voting for A.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,It looks like everyone agrees.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Yes, A is the clear choice.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Rin,,Great. I can stop worrying about the monthly math.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's finalize the rates based on the data.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Misaki,,Thank you. This should help us get along better.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
